      "side": 1,
      "message": "huge collapse should be happening with everything else locked out, it should have mmap lock held exclusively and be under vm_write_begin(), triggering a bailout on vma_has_changed().\nFrom what I can tell, collapse_pte_mapped_thp() and retract_page_tables() don\u0027t currently use vm_write_begin() (only collapse_huge_page() uses it) but that should be addressed in the THP code, not here.\n\n(But if you want to keep this check here additionally in case something\u0027s wrong on the THP end, and document that this is a redundant safety check, I\u0027m not opposed to that.)",
